Third party notices

This project is an independent reimplementation of file format knowledge that is
publicly documented (gtamods.com wiki, community research). It contains no code
from Rockstar Games.

Ideas and format constants were cross-checked against these MIT/community tools,
which are kept in refs/ (not part of this repository):

  * g3DTZ by guard3 (MIT) - GAME.DTZ / GAME.DAT extraction approach
  * cso-to-iso by CydVilla (MIT) - CSO/ZSO block layout
  * psp_gtatools by the community (community licence) - RAW/SDT notes

GTA, Liberty City Stories and Vice City Stories are trademarks of their
respective owners. This tool ships no game data.